her is a Marine Biologist, and he is in search of a creature known as the Glowing Whale. When He finds the bones of one of these, he is saddened, and resolves to change his mission towards preserving and caring for the creatures. Nanami befriends an Orca which she names Tico, and She goes swimming with it every day. Eventually, she learns to breathe Underwater which astounds her Father. Nanami nearly drowns one day, and one of the glowing whales saves her from certain death and returns her to the vessel, where her Father finally gets to see it.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Outdoor Activities","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Environmental","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ships","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Travel","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kids","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ojou-sama","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Educational","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coastal","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Pregnancy","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Tico and Friends","english":"Tico and Friends","native":"七つの海のティコ","romaji":"Nanatsu no Umi no Tico","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"七海的堤可"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Nanatsu no Umi no Tiko"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"深海中的朋友"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"七海小英雄"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}